eated by Rhode Island's Gorham Manufacturing Company for the 1892 World's Columbian Exposition in Chicago.","Statue of Christopher Columbus (Johnston, Rhode Island)"],"18151402":["Marquis de Lafayette is an outdoor bronze sculpture of Gilbert du Motier, Marquis de Lafayette by artist Frédéric Auguste Bartholdi, located at Union Square Park in Manhattan, New York.","Statue of the Marquis de Lafayette (New York City)"]}}